        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Goals and progress</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-width: 1180px;\n      background: #f2f2f7;\n      color: #39393b;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .topbar {\n      height: 112px;\n      padding: 58px 3.2% 0;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      color: #737376;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      line-height: 26px;\n    }\n    .nav, .report {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 30px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .nav .active {\n      color: #38383a;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      border-bottom: 2px solid #00c73c;\n      padding-bottom: 1px;\n    }\n    .report { gap: 36px; }\n    main {\n      padding: 184px 3.15% 90px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 66px;\n      color: #353537;\n      font-size: 104px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: -4px;\n    }\n    .sections {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 46px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      margin: 0 0 31px;\n      font-size: 38px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: -1.4px;\n    }\n    .panel {\n      min-height: 1059px;\n      padding: 43px 47px 34px;\n      background: #fff;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n    }\n    .head, .row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 37% 22% 41%;\n    }\n    .head {\n      padding-bottom: 7px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #16c54b;\n      color: #38383a;\n      font-size: 23px;\n      line-height: 26px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .row {\n      padding: 14px 0 33px;\n      color: #757577;\n      font-size: 23px;\n      line-height: 1.43;\n    }\n    .row + .row {\n      padding-top: 14px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #a7a7a8;\n    }\n    .status {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      gap: 11px;\n      color: #39393b;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .marker {\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      width: 35px;\n      height: 35px;\n      margin-top: 0;\n      border: 2px solid #00c73c;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: #b9efc8;\n      color: #2f4034;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      line-height: 1;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .marker.check {\n      background: #00c73c;\n      color: #123419;\n      font-size: 24px;\n    }\n    .marker.new {\n      background: #fff;\n      font-size: 23px;\n    }\n    sup {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 0;\n      vertical-align: super;\n    }\n    .materials .panel { min-height: 1059px; }\n    .materials .row { padding-bottom: 32px; }\n    .resources .row { padding-bottom: 32px; }\n    @media (max-width: 1600px) {\n      body { min-width: 0; }\n      .topbar { font-size: 16px; }\n      main { padding-top: 120px; }\n      h1 { font-size: 76px; }\n      .sections { gap: 25px; }\n      .panel { padding: 32px 30px; }\n      .head { font-size: 18px; }\n      .row { font-size: 18px; }\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 950px) {\n      .topbar { padding: 28px 24px 0; height: 85px; overflow: hidden; }\n      .nav { gap: 16px; }\n      .report { display: none; }\n      main { padding: 80px 24px 45px; }\n      h1 { margin-bottom: 45px; font-size: 58px; letter-spacing: -2px; }\n      .sections { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .panel { min-height: auto; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <nav class=\"nav\">\n      <span>Contents</span>\n      <span class=\"active\">Introduction</span>\n      <span>Environmental Initiatives</span>\n      <span>Engagement and Advocacy</span>\n      <span>Data</span>\n      <span>Appendix</span>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"report\">\n      <span>2024 Environmental Progress Report</span>\n      <span>5</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <h1>Goals and progress</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"sections\">\n      <section>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Emissions</h2>\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"head\">\n            <div>Goals</div>\n            <div>Progress</div>\n            <div>Highlights</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Become carbon neutral for<br>our corporate operations.</div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker check\">✓</span><span>Achieved</span></div>\n            <div>We achieved carbon neutrality<br>in 2020 by expanding energy<br>efficiency initiatives, sourcing<br>100 percent renewable<br>electricity for Apple facilities,<br>and investing in high-quality<br>carbon credits to offset the<br>remaining hard-to-decarbonize<br>corporate emissions.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Achieve carbon neutrality for<br>our entire carbon footprint<br>by 2030 — reducing related<br>emissions by 75 percent<br>compared with 2015.<sup>6</sup></div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker\">•••</span><span>Ongoing</span></div>\n            <div>Since 2015, we’ve reduced<br>emissions by over 55 percent<br>across our value chain.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Transition our entire<br>value chain, including<br>manufacturing and product<br>use, to 100 percent clean<br>electricity by 2030.<sup>7</sup></div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker\">•••</span><span>Ongoing</span></div>\n            <div>As of March 2024, more than<br>320 suppliers have committed<br>to use 100 renewable energy<br>for their Apple production.<br>These suppliers account<br>for 95 percent of Apple’s<br>direct spend for materials,<br>manufacturing, and assembly<br>of our products worldwide.<sup>8</sup></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"materials\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Materials</h2>\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"head\">\n            <div>Goals</div>\n            <div>Progress</div>\n            <div>Highlight</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Use only recycled and<br>renewable materials in our<br>products and packaging, and<br>enhance material recovery.</div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker\">•••</span><span>Ongoing</span></div>\n            <div>In 2023, 22 percent of the<br>material we shipped in our<br>products came from recycled<br>or renewable sources, and<br>we also added titanium to our<br>priority materials list in 2023.<sup>9</sup></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Transition to 100 percent<br>recycled cobalt, tin, gold,<br>and rare earth elements<br>in select components and<br>applications by 2025.<sup>10</sup></div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker\">•••</span><span>Ongoing</span></div>\n            <div>In 2023, 56 percent of the<br>cobalt shipped in Apple-<br>designed batteries came<br>from recycled sources.<sup>11</sup></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Remove plastics from our<br>packaging by 2025.<sup>12</sup></div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker\">•••</span><span>Ongoing</span></div>\n            <div>Our product packaging<br>shipped in 2023 contains only<br>3 percent plastic — down from<br>21 percent in 2015.<sup>13</sup></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"resources\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Resources</h2>\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"head\">\n            <div>Goals</div>\n            <div>Progress</div>\n            <div>Highlight</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Replenish all our corporate<br>freshwater withdrawals<br>in high-stress locations<br>by 2030.<sup>14</sup></div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker\">•••</span><span>Ongoing</span></div>\n            <div>We’ve partnered on freshwater<br>replenishment projects resulting<br>in 31.2 million gallons of<br>volumetric water benefits.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Certify all Apple-owned data<br>centers to the Alliance for<br>Water Stewardship (AWS)<br>Standard by 2025.<sup>15</sup></div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker\">•••</span><span>Ongoing</span></div>\n            <div>We’ve certified five data<br>centers since 2021, and 20<br>suppliers since 2017 to the<br>AWS Standard.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Expand and grow supplier<br>participation in the Supplier<br>Clean Water Program,<br>prioritizing high water<br>stress locations and driving<br>participants to an average<br>50 percent water reuse rate<br>by 2030.<sup>16</sup></div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker new\">✳</span><span>New</span></div>\n            <div>Through our program,<br>we’ve supported an average<br>42 percent reuse rate<br>across our 242 participating<br>supplier facilities.</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div>Eliminate waste sent to<br>landfill from our corporate<br>facilities and our suppliers.</div>\n            <div class=\"status\"><span class=\"marker\">•••</span><span>Ongoing</span></div>\n            <div>Our corporate facilities waste<br>diversion rate increased to<br>74 percent, driven by progress<br>at our data centers.<br><br>Throughout 2023, 100 percent<br>of established final<br>assembly sites maintained<br>zero-waste-to-landfill operations.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
